       <p>
          <center>
          <a asp-area="" asp-page="/viewTCA1"><span id="linkViewTca1" 
              style="color:Navy;font-size:1.0em;"><b>Software Unit Testing, part 1</b></span></a><br>
          </center>
          <center>
          <span id="textViewTca1Introduction" style="color:Grey;font-size:0.875em;">
             Part 1 of a discussion on 
             <span id="textTCA1Emphasized1" style="color:Navy;"><b>Software Unit Testing</b></span> for 
             <span id="textTCA1Emphasized2" style="color:Navy;"><b>Desktop</b></span>, 
             <span id="textTCA1Emphasized3" style="color:Navy;"><b>Mobile</b></span> and 
             <span id="textTCA1Emphasized4" style="color:Navy;"><b>Web</b></span> applications. 
             The section on Web testing focuses on the use of 
             <span id="textTCA1Emphasized5" style="color:Navy;"><b>Cypress</b></span> (page 9), 
             a modern test framework for Web apps and Web pages. 
          </span>
          </center>
       </p>

       <p>
          <center>
          <a asp-area="" asp-page="/viewTCA2"><span id="linkViewTca2" 
              style="color:Navy;font-size:1.0em;"><b>Software Unit Testing, part 2</b></span></a><br>
          </center>
          <center>
          <span id="textViewTca2Introduction" style="color:Grey;font-size:0.875em;">
             Part 2 of a discussion on
             <span id="textTCA2Emphasized1" style="color:Navy;"><b>Software Unit Testing</b></span>.
             This article discusses testing of software written in the 
             <span id="textTCA2Emphasized2" style="color:Navy;"><b>C#</b></span> 
             language using 
             <span id="textTCA2Emphasized3" style="color:Navy;"><b>.NET</b></span>.
             Includes a discussion of  
             <span id="textTCA2Emphasized4" style="color:Navy;"><b>xUnit</b></span> 
              ( 
              <a href="https://xunit.net" target="_blank"><span id="linkXunit1" 
                  style="color:Navy;font-size:16px;">
                  <b>https://xunit.net</b></span></a> 
              ), a popular modern test framework which is used for testing .NET software.
          </span>
          </center>
       </p>

       <p>
          <center>
          <a asp-area="" asp-page="/viewTCA3"><span id="linkViewTca3" 
              style="color:Navy;font-size:1.0em;"><b>Software Unit Testing, part 3</b></span></a><br>
          </center>
          <center>
          <span id="textViewTca3Introduction" style="color:Grey;font-size:0.875em;">
             Part 3 of a discussion on
             <span id="textTCA3Emphasized1" style="color:Navy;"><b>Software Unit Testing</b></span>.
             This article discusses testing of software written in the 
             <span id="textTCA3Emphasized2" style="color:Navy;"><b>C++</b></span> 
             language. 
             Discusses Software Unit Testing using a generic testing framework as well as the modern 
             <span id="textTCA3Emphasized4" style="color:Navy;"><b>Google Test</b></span> 
             testing framework.
          </span>
          </center>
       </p>

       <p>
          <center>
          <a asp-area="" asp-page="/viewTCA4"><span id="linkViewTca4" 
              style="color:Navy;font-size:1.0em;"><b>Software Unit Testing, part 4</b></span></a><br>
          </center>
          <center>
          <span id="textViewTca4Introduction" style="color:Grey;font-size:0.875em;">
             Part 4 of a discussion on
             <span id="textTCA4Emphasized1" style="color:Navy;"><b>Software Unit Testing</b></span>. 
             Discusses Software Unit Testing using the modern 
             <span id="textTCA4Emphasized2" style="color:Navy;"><b>Playwright</b></span> 
             testing framework.
          </span>
          </center>
       </p>

